--- OLD
@OptionChosen:              ; Jumps here when the player presses A or Start (selected an option)
    LDA cursor              ;  this CMP will set C if they selected option 1 (New Game)
    CMP #1                  ;  and will clear C if they selected option 0 (Continue)
    RTS                     ;  then exit!
--- NEW
@OptionChosen:              ; Jumps here when the player presses A or Start (selected an option)
    ;  ...or Select, which TitleScreen_Music now reports too.  Which button
    ;  on which row means what is opt_titlechoose's to say, in the flags:
    ;
    ;    N set  nothing to do: Select off Continue, or with no save
    ;    Z set  one of its screens was shown -- the settings, the credits or
    ;           the save view.  Come back through the top of the title
    ;           screen rather than into its loop: TitleScreen_Copyright calls
    ;           IntroTitlePrepare, which reloads the menu CHR the screen
    ;           overwrote and clears the nametable.
    ;    else   leave, with C set for New Game and clear for Continue -- what
    ;           the CMP #1 that was here gave
    JSL opt_titlechoose + OPTFAR
    BMI @Loop
    BEQ @Again
    RTS
  @Again:
    JMP EnterTitleScreen
    .res 16 - (* - @OptionChosen), $EA      ; the size the call site was
